                              target="https://hdl.handle.net/2027/uiug.30112113075359"
                                 ><title>Medieval Libraries of Great Britain: A List of Surviving
                                 Books</title></ref>, Royal Historical Society Guides and Handbooks,
                           3 (London, 1941; <ref target="https://hdl.handle.net/2027/uva.x000937945"
                              >2nd edn, 1964</ref>; <ref
                              target="https://hdl.handle.net/2027/mdp.39015021966216">supplement,
                              ed. Andrew G. Watson, 1987</ref>; digital edn, ed. Richard Sharpe and
                           James M. W. Willoughby, 2010–15).</source>
                     </recordHist>
                  </adminInfo>
               </additional>
